[38;5;231m⏺[39m Added it to [38;5;153mindex.html:14-17[39m.

  - A native [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m wrapped in a [38;5;153m<label>[39m so clicking the text toggles it. On/off state is the browser's
