  - One CSS rule ([38;5;153mindex.html:7-9[39m) strikes through the label text when checked, so "done" is visible.

  The item text is a placeholder; swap it or repeat the [38;5;153m<label class="task">[39m block per task. No tests were run — the
  repo has no test setup, just the single static page.

